WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.690
Under the command of the Buff Clan
soldier, Guhaba Geba,

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:32.660
the new Zurow Jick fighters,

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:35.650
and the Heavy Mobile Mecha Zigg
Mack launched a brutal assault.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.340
Ideon and the Solo Ship sustained
massive damage,

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.570
but fought on and escaped.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.710
<b>Doku's Attack Strategy</b>

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:12.900
Cosmo!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.530
Go ask Vent if we've got spare
armor.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:16.430
Roger!

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.050
Cosmo, I made a chart of
the missile arrangement.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:19.490
Okay.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.240
The Missile Launcher isn't in place yet.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.250
Haven't I told you that kids aren't
allowed on the bridge?

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:29.080
Bes asked me to bring food here!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.000
Do you want to work without eating anything, Sheryl?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.920
We have a cafeteria for that purpose!

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.970
Lin! I want a hamburger!

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.000
Yes!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.920
You're certain that you can win?

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.320
Jilbarl Doku...

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:52.300
As a Heavy Mobile Mecha developer,
I have my own battle methods.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:55.580
If you lend me a Heavy Mobile Mecha unit...

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.390
I'll be able to destroy that Giant!

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:03.370
Knowing your technological skills, I'll take your word for it.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:18.210
This is the Solo Ship from Planet Solo, 208th military district. We are being chased by aliens.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.580
It's no use, the communications have been cut from the other side!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.100
How can they ignore the disaster we're in?!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.630
Because they don't believe us.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.180
They don't believe us?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:33.050
Until now, we've never encountered any aliens directly.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:38.230
Who would believe that we were attacked by aliens?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.210
But...

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.500
Even if they were to trace us...

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.320
Brazillier?!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.220
This is Solo Ship from the 208th military
district, planet Solo!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.570
Requesting help!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.740
You were able to contact Brazillier?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:50.490
Yeah.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.990
They're one of Andromeda's front line bases.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:54.580
Yes!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.460
There are refugees aboard our ship!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.710
Please let us in!

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.170
Bes!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.560
When one door shuts, another opens.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.970
If we go to Brazillier...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:03.820
But, however...

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:07.070
We don't have enough soldiers, but with Brazillier's defense...

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.080
That's right.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.140
We can fight back against the Buff Clan forces, Bes!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.430
Are we really going to Brazillier?

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.170
W-Wait a minute!

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.770
We don't know if we've completely thrown off the Buff Clan...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.900
Enemies detected at 5 o'clock!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.030
They'll enter our battle range in 30 seconds!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:39.590
Sol Amber! Change to Ideo-Delta!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.730
One enemy unit has launched.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:49.890
All Zurow Jicks! Get into battle formation!

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.390
All missiles and Glen Cannons, prepare for anti-aircraft fire!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.070
Glen Cannons, roger!

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.310
Missile Launcher 3, roger!

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.070
Missile Launcher 5, roger!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:06.230
Moera! Cosmo's Ideo-Delta too far ahead! Hurry up!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.900
Do you know how many enemies there are?

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.820
My laser sensor is obstructed by all these rocks!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.990
They're not close enough!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:16.540
Over there!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.680
Caution, all units!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.260
The enemy's numbers have increased!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.600
Did they get backup?

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.100
How should I know?!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.590
They're coming!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.400
We need to draw them further in!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:55.500
From the right?!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.320
Sir Doku! Two more units are approaching us!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.130
I think they're also parts of the Giant.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.660
Send the Zero Zurows against them! Stay away from the vanguard unit!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.400
Yes sir!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:28.170
The three Zigg Macks will concentrate solely on that unit and destroy it.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.050
Yes sir!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:32.490
After it's destroyed, salvage any parts you can!

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.470
They'll be the key to solving the mystery of the Giant.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:34.910
Yes sir!

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.510
Isn't the barrier working?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.880
Everyone, give me a damage report!

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.850
Glen Cannon! Are you alright?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.980
What's wrong, everyone?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.150
Answer me!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.600
Sir Doku!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.410
Looks like it worked!

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.790
Don't be hasty! Keep firing the particle cannon for five more seconds.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:30.790
Okay!

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.220
Let's search the Giant machine!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:32.720
Yes sir!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.250
Damn it!

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.020
Damn it, move!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:07:59.970
Is there any sign of life?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.600
I can faintly detect something.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.640
Looks like it's armor got heavily damaged.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:04.370
Yes!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.080
Every part is overheating!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:15.960
Continue attacking until there's
no sign of life inside!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.520
Someone! Fire a missile!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.720
Just one is enough! Fire!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.110
The monitor shut down?

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.730
All the monitors are dead?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.260
What's going on?!

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:36.780
The power's not rising!

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.440
I can't defend myself!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.530
Is... Is it all over? How can this be...

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.900
The other two units are approaching!

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.780
Send a Zigg Mack over there!

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:00.890
The enemy's ship is also getting close to us!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.140
All right!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.200
Stop the attack!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.280
Seize the enemy unit!

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.090
Yes sir!

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:14.040
After seizing the Giant machine, draw back at once.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:14.890
Hurry!

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.150
W-What the?

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.950
Okay, let's go!

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:37.630
Did they break through the Zero Zurow squadron?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.720
Oh?! The Ideo-Delta?!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.570
Let go of the Giant machine!
Fire at the enemy!

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.050
Can you find Brazillier's coordinates?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:18.610
I can do it!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.650
We'll enter DS Drive once we
rescue Cosmo's Ideo-Delta!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:22.460
Roger!

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.890
Bes! Do you mean...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.700
Yes.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.890
Cosmo's in danger! He's not replying.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.230
We need to rescue him.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.190
Joliver!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.750
If the enemy gets behind the Solo Ship, turn on the anti-matter engine!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.050
Cosmo! Answer me!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.490
Let's dock!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.610
Cosmo! Answer me!

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.020
Cosmo, Moera! Listen!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.900
The Solo Ship
is about to enter DS Drive!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:00.040
Land on the Solo Ship's deck!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.130
Land? Can we do it?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.320
Ideo-Delta has been located!

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.160
Joliver!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.120
DS Drive!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.770
Okay! Anti-matter engine!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.010
To full power!

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.190
All Ideon units! Land!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.170
You won't get away!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.680
Huh?!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.950
All units, pull back! It's an anti-matter engine!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:32.930
Those damn aliens!

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:35.630
Do you think you can flee through subspace?

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.070
It's the Brazillier base!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.480
Everyone, prepare for landing!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:16.130
I find it hard to believe that you have encountered...

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.520
...two different alien races at the same time in this vast universe.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.840
If you investigate the Solo
Ship, you'll understand.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.070
The probability is rather slim.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.100
In any case, we'll investigate it, Bes.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:31.170
Commander Camyula, I'm no longer the elementary school kid I was back then.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.800
I'm sorry, Jordan Bes.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:35.940
Who is that boy?

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.510
Yuuki Cosmo.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.420
The son of Dr. Yuuki from the Science Department?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.100
Yes.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.350
Is something wrong with him?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:46.100
He was chosen to pilot a war machine left behind by the 6th civilization.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.010
This child?

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.570
Yes. However...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:52.070
Are you tired?

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:53.700
Or frightened?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.320
I feel sorry for you.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.220
It's alright, Cosmo!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.980
Now that you're here, there's nothing to be afraid of.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:01.800
Commander Camyula Lanban.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:02.760
Yes?

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.360
I believe that the combat capability
 of this base is insufficient.

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:07.610
Are you joking?

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:11.780
Brazillier is a front line base. We possess the required number of fighter crafts.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.990
Required by what standard?

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.400
We follow the regulations set by the Space Alliance Military.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.950
So, what's your name?

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:19.960
Commander Camyula!

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.150
As Kasha was saying, you don't
have enough battle strength here!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.810
We are soldiers.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:26.280
Combat professionals!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:30.010
But have you ever fought against aliens?

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.140
We go through harsh training on a daily basis.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:36.720
All of it is for the sake of protecting you civilians.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.780
Ma'am...

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:39.490
You're very kind.

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:42.380
Cosmo?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.620
You really have kind eyes.

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:47.340
Ma'am...

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:48.880
Bes.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:51.300
Please report in detail to the officials.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:54.550
Can we ask for supplies for the Solo Ship?

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.620
I'll do what I can.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.640
Come on, Cosmo.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.330
Commander!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:04.500
Don't you believe that this woman is one of the Buff Clan aliens?

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:07.650
It sounds like a bad joke, but...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.360
An alien?

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:14.220
Circumstances have led to her becoming our ally.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.330
My name is Karala Ajiba.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.170
I want the medical officers to thoroughly inspect this woman.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:20.870
Yes!

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:24.160
Hats off to you for playing it so straight.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:27.800
Camyula Lanban!

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:34.200
The enemy is near, raise the subspace navigator to full power!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:34.760
Yes ma'am!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.190
In your opinion, should we attack the alien ship?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:42.810
Yes.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:48.310
I couldn't finish them off because the Zurow Jick squadron dispersed too much.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:52.360
I don't know where the tracking device is leading us, but...

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.280
What's this?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.380
Don't throw anything away!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.160
We don't fully understand the artifacts
of the sixth civilization.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.800
Is this really an artifact?

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.780
It'd be great if we could create
metal to improve the armor.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.380
How are you going to get materials?

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.260
There's as much as we need inside the stardust.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:20.000
Lou, what's wrong? You need to eat.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.050
Maybe he wanted to stay on the Solo Ship.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:31.770
How do you like this place?

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:34.530
It's the best recreation center in Brazillier.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.890
I have a son about your age.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.910
We separated about 10 years ago, though...

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:45.480
Just ask me if you need anything.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.910
You'll feel better.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.630
I could take you to a doctor,

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.870
but your eyes are shining.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:54.820
You're alright.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.320
You're a strong kid...

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.140
You're going to get better in an instant.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.970
I'm not a boy anymore! I'm a man!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.200
I don't need your consultation.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:05.290
I can handle everything on my own!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.780
Don't pretend to be nice to me!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:12.070
My mom would tell me to do this or that,
only whenever it was convenient for her.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.290
I'm no mama's boy.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.510
I'm a man!

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:16.720
I can fight!

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:18.690
I can protect everyone!

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:20.660
Even from that attack...

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.660
from the Buff Clan attack!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.110
That...

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:26.700
The Buff... Buff...

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.500
That Buff Clan attack...

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.800
Cosmo!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.930
Cosmo!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.600
Cosmo! Calm down!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:49.980
Cosmo...

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.770
Attention! Unidentified units approaching from 180 degrees behind!

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.220
Sound the primary alarm sirens!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.400
Did you send out Quartet?

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.210
Missiles!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.380
Have the Glenn Cannons been manned yet?

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.190
We're gathering our troops!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:37.730
Make it fast!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.470
Cosmo, have you worn a spacesuit before?

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:47.760
Of course.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.560
In that case, try this on.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.910
I think you'll look good in it.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.170
Okay, I'll do it.

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.930
Ideo-Nova has launched!

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.760
Bring the disembarked units back to Solo Ship!

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.900
Get a substitute pilot for the Ideo-Delta!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.480
You're looking great, Cosmo.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:25.080
I'll bring you back to the Solo Ship right away.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.710
Cosmo! Cosmo!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.070
Cosmo!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:45.490
Are you alright!?

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.590
Are you injured?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.390
Cosmo!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.920
You're alright, aren't you?

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.440
Cosmo!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.900
I'm glad...

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:16.910
You can walk, right?

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:18.860
You're fine...

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:20.710
It'll be alright.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:21.880
Cosmo...

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:55.130
Cosmo! Are you alright?!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.250
We're launching the Ideo-Delta!

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:03.590
Go!

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.100
The three Giant machines have gathered!

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.820
Don't get distracted by the small fry! The Giant is here!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:50.720
Arm Attack!

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:01.250
Can the Zero Zurows enter a narrow space like this?

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:02.150
It's coming!

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:26.470
Attack!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.930
Revenge for Camyula Lanban!

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:46.340
What the?!

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:49.940
A third of our forces, gone
in the blink of an eye!

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:51.580
A third...!

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.910
Damn you, Buff Clan!

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:00.160
Damn you, Buff Clan...

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.200
...I'll destroy you all!

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:55.920
<i>Sheryl and Karala flee from the Solo Ship only
to be taken hostage by the Buff Clan.</i>

00:22:57.070 --> 00:23:01.950
<i>What is Cosmo planning when he accepts their demand to hand over the Ideon?</i>

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:05.520
<i>Enemy soldiers board the Ideon before their eyes.</i>

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:08.980
<i>Can the Ideon be successfully retrieved?</i>

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:14.780
